{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1738807572\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the world of Reptilian!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You're a young lizard named Isaac, who just recently arrived from the jungle at the famous Reptilian Resort Oasis!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Living his whole life in the rainforests, Isaac has always dreamed of seeing his first sunset, and this oasis is rumored to have the best sunset in the world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the perfect spot to bask in the sunset, and maybe meet some friends along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore, meet new friends, and achieve your greatest dreams in the Reptilian Resort!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1738807572\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3369190?t=1738807572","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738807572","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/0e54c75671187a5f1932fec4b258cd04a6009f21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738807572","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369190/0e54c75671187a5f1932fec4b258cd04a6009f21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738807572","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369